id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45368::$$$message_0417_0000_0000$$$::"Lancer!? What are you doing here?"::
45369::$$$message_0417_0000_0001$$$::"I've been waiting for you, Saber. This time, let us have an honorable duel."::
45370::$$$message_0417_0000_0002$$$::"Lancer, wait! You're being deceived! Actually, I might be, too. I don't even know what's going on anymore!"::
45371::$$$message_0417_0000_0003$$$::"...What?"::
45372::$$$message_0417_0000_0004$$$::"What are you doing, Lancer? They are Masters after the Holy Grail bath too. Dispose of them and clear the way."::
45373::$$$message_0417_0000_0005$$$::"Ooh, I can't believe I get to witness Lancer being all stylish in action..."::
45374::$$$message_0417_0000_0006$$$::"His Master looks ready to throw down.[wvl][se storage=SE_0036.wav][wait canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=驚き pos=center time=400 twno=1][hfsigh layer=2] Oh, a phone call. Um..."::
45375::$$$message_0417_0000_0007$$$::"Listen, Iri. Provoke Saber so that the fish doesn't get away. I'm going to secure a sniping position."::
45376::$$$message_0417_0000_0008$$$::"...Um."::
45377::$$$message_0417_0000_0009$$$::"Saber, I think we should settle things with Lancer as soon as possible. The longer we drag this out, the worse it's going to get."::
45378::$$$message_0417_0000_0010$$$::"Argh. I understand, Irisviel. Now that it's come to this, we have no choice."::
45379::$$$message_0417_0000_0011$$$::"Let us duel!"::

